<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carpentārĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		carpentum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to a
			wagon</i> or <i>chariot</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fabricae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 8, 13, § 34</span></i>
			: artifex, 
			<i>a wagon</i>- or <i>carriage-maker</i>, <i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev.
			52</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fabri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					50, 6, 6</span></i>
			: vehiculu m = carpentum, Treb. XXX. Tyrann.
			29.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carpentārĭus</span></b> , ii,
				m., <i>a carriage-driver</i>, <i>coachman</i>, Cod. Th. 8, 5, 31.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carpentārĭa</span></b> , ae,
			f. (sc. fabrica), <i>a wagon</i>- or <i>carriage - maker</i>'<i>s
			workshop</i>, Firm. 2, 10.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
